    "tree_id": "45c5a670dcfc76ad2104e48f879d286d103dd7e0",
    "message": "[ascend](feat) add TLA sync interfaces\n\nAdd tla.sync split into per-op builder bindings (barrier, set_flag,\nwait_flag, sync_all, block_set_flag, block_wait_flag) with shared pipe\nvalidation and core-type inference in the builder.\n\nTests live under tla_ut/sync and follow the 3-stage case template:\n- sync_intra: out = a + b with hand-inserted MTE2->V->MTE3 pipeline\n  synchronization, barrier and sync_all, verified end to end.\n- sync_inter: cube gemm handoff to the vector core through an FFTS flag,\n  verified end to end.\n\nAssisted-by: AI",
    "timestamp": "2026-10-27T12:33:08Z",
